od SecureString secrets with the CHANGEME placeholder (write-only arg, invisible in the plan diff)'","The plan's stop condition is expressed purely in terms of plan-visible resource_changes ('destroys or changes outside the Current Fresh-Plan Envelope')"],"finding":"The stop-condition mechanism is a plan-diff gate, but the SecureString secrets (rebar_secrets) use write-only value_wo, which the provider and repo both document as invisible in the plan diff and absent from state; the gate therefore cannot detect a value_wo re-send of CHANGEME over live secrets during the adopting apply.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f282900fc6927e41e","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Current Fresh-Plan Envelope (2026-09-07) / Operator Approval and Scope ('stop without mutation if a fresh plan shows destroys or changes outside the envelope')","norm_id":"n6cc4274303d33f5b","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The three mcp-client-pat imports adopt at value_wo_version=1 and the adopting apply re-sends value_wo=CHANGEME, silently clobbering the live bearer tokens even though the plan diff showed only import no-ops","The value_wo cutover has not yet been applied to prod state and rides this apply, re-seeding SecureStrings to CHANGEME with no diff signal"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.3333,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"yes","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","d